Licensing of the files under data/suites/

The files in this directory are released under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

The repository's code is under the MIT license (../../LICENSE). That license
does not cover these files.

What the files are
------------------
Each file is a selection derived from one of three public connectome datasets:
root IDs of neurons chosen for masking, cell-type names, neuropil names,
sha256 digests, counts and sampling parameters. No connectivity, synapse,
morphology or coordinate data is included. The root IDs, cell-type names and
neuropil names are taken from the source datasets and are not changed.

The source datasets are released under CC BY or CC BY-NC terms. CC BY 4.0
allows adapted material to be shared under more restrictive terms, so one
CC BY-NC 4.0 license covers all three directories. You must also credit each
source dataset as listed below.

Source datasets
---------------
f1/  FlyWire v783 (F1)
     License:  CC BY-NC 4.0, per https://flywire.ai/guidelines
               ("FlyWire's public release data is made available under
               license CC BY-NC 4.0"). The Zenodo record
               https://zenodo.org/records/10676866 is tagged CC BY 4.0; the
               stricter FlyWire statement is applied here because the
               cell-type names come from FlyWire's annotations.
     Data:     https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10676866
     Cite:     Dorkenwald, S., Matsliah, A., Sterling, A.R., Schlegel, P.,
               et al. Neuronal wiring diagram of an adult brain. Nature 634,
               124-138 (2024). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07558-y
               Schlegel, P., Yin, Y., Bates, A.S., Dorkenwald, S., et al.
               Whole-brain annotation and multi-connectome cell typing of
               Drosophila. Nature 634, 139-152 (2024).
               https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07686-5

f2/  BANC v888 (F2)
     License:  CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
     Data:     https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/7WTH1N (Harvard Dataverse)
     Cite:     Bates, A.S., Phelps, J.S., Kim, M., Yang, H.H., et al.
               Distributed control circuits across a brain-and-cord
               connectome. Nature 656, 957-970 (2026).
               https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10735-w

f3/  Male CNS v1.0 (F3)
     License:  CC BY, as stated at https://male-cns.janelia.org/download/
               ("The Male CNS is licensed under CC-BY"). The page does not
               name a license version.
     Data:     https://male-cns.janelia.org/
     Cite:     Berg, S., Beckett, I.R., Costa, M., Schlegel, P., et al.
               Sexual dimorphism in the complete Drosophila male central
               nervous system connectome. Cell 189(18), 5504-5526.e15 (2026).
               https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015

Changes made
------------
The files select and record a subset of each dataset's neuron IDs and names for
the experiments in this repository, and add sampling parameters and digests.

This is a reading of the sources' published license statements, not legal
advice. For FlyWire licensing questions, contact flywire@princeton.edu.
